              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas daraaddeed Saa'uul wuu ka noqday Daa'uud kii uu eryanayay, oo wuxuu u kacay kuwii reer Falastiin, sidaas aawadeed waxay meeshaas u bixiyeen Selac Hammaxleqood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
